WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.488 --> 00:00:13.989
Roxy felt her powers drain.

2
00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:16.912
King Trog's ring began to glow.

3
00:00:16.932 --> 00:00:22.316
"Soon I'll have your powers, little girl," he said.

4
00:00:22.336 --> 00:00:25.018
"And you'll be gone!"

5
00:00:26.279 --> 00:00:27.720
Professor Beard bit his lip.

6
00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.782
"I just wanted some treasure.

7
00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:31.984
I don't want anyone to get hurt."

8
00:00:34.376 --> 00:00:35.477
Roxy fell to the ground.

9
00:00:36.238 --> 00:00:37.279
The crowd gasped.

10
00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:40.121
Professor Beard sighed.

11
00:00:40.141 --> 00:00:42.063
"I can't let this happen."

12
00:00:42.563 --> 00:00:43.184
He ran over.

13
00:00:43.204 --> 00:00:45.926
"Rocket Girl!

14
00:00:46.226 --> 00:00:47.147
Get Trog's ring!

15
00:00:48.008 --> 00:00:49.149
Then he'll go back to sleep!"

16
00:00:50.289 --> 00:00:51.350
Roxy blinked slowly.

17
00:00:52.151 --> 00:00:54.173
She had just a tiny amount of power left.

18
00:00:55.614 --> 00:01:03.348
She focused Whiz-hoo!

19
00:01:03.368 --> 00:01:05.149
Her eye laser beams hit the glowing ring.

20
00:01:05.809 --> 00:01:09.811
"Grarg!" King Trog's ring stopped glowing.

21
00:01:10.691 --> 00:01:12.072
It now had a small crack.

22
00:01:12.912 --> 00:01:14.133
Roxy's powers returned.

23
00:01:15.413 --> 00:01:16.814
She pulled the band off her head.

24
00:01:17.934 --> 00:01:19.175
King Trog growled.

25
00:01:20.735 --> 00:01:22.376
Roxy shot toward the caveman.

26
00:01:23.096 --> 00:01:25.077
His big fist pounded into Roxy.

27
00:01:25.097 --> 00:01:28.138
"Gah!" Roxy slammed into the street.

28
00:01:28.699 --> 00:01:29.859
She jumped back to her feet.

29
00:01:30.399 --> 00:01:33.540
Again she flew toward King Trog.

30
00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:35.442
He punched, but Roxy moved out of the way.

31
00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:37.263
Then Pow!

32
00:01:38.064 --> 00:01:39.865
Roxy flew into King Trog's gut.

33
00:01:39.885 --> 00:01:43.028
"Oof!" King Trog fell to his knees.

34
00:01:43.729 --> 00:01:45.150
Roxy grabbed his big finger.

35
00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:46.851
She pulled the ring off.

36
00:01:48.673 --> 00:01:51.094
The caveman's eyes closed, and he lay still.

37
00:01:55.698 --> 00:01:56.319
Roxy said.

38
00:01:57.079 --> 00:01:58.320
Professor Beard ran over.

39
00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:00.142
"I'm sorry, Rocket Girl.

40
00:02:00.602 --> 00:02:02.564
I took King Trog's ring from the museum.

41
00:02:03.336 --> 00:02:04.197
I wanted to wake him."

42
00:02:05.017 --> 00:02:06.258
Roxy raised an eyebrow.

43
00:02:06.278 --> 00:02:09.060
"Why did you want to wake him?"

44
00:02:10.061 --> 00:02:11.242
Professor Beard sighed.

45
00:02:11.282 --> 00:02:15.825
"A legend says that King Trog rewards anyone who wakes him.

46
00:02:16.686 --> 00:02:18.167
I didn't know he was dangerous."

47
00:02:19.428 --> 00:02:20.729
Roxy folded her arms.

48
00:02:20.749 --> 00:02:22.750
"It's okay, Professor.

49
00:02:23.171 --> 00:02:24.632
But I need your help now."

50
00:02:24.652 --> 00:02:27.314
"Of course," Professor Beard said.

51
00:02:27.334 --> 00:02:28.795
"What do you need?"

52
00:02:29.675 --> 00:02:31.568
Roxy shrugged.

53
00:02:31.588 --> 00:02:33.209
"I don't know where to put King Trog."

54
00:02:36.211 --> 00:02:38.773
Roxy and Professor Beard stood in King Trog's cave.

55
00:02:39.574 --> 00:02:41.055
The caveman lay on his stone.

56
00:02:42.015 --> 00:02:43.536
Roxy gave Professor Beard the ring.

57
00:02:43.556 --> 00:02:46.318
"I'll put this back in the museum," he said.

58
00:02:46.959 --> 00:02:47.639
Roxy nodded.

59
00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:50.341
Then she looked at the sleeping caveman.

60
00:02:50.361 --> 00:02:52.243
"Sleep tight, Trog."

61
00:02:54.424 --> 00:02:55.645
Roxy returned to the museum.

62
00:02:55.665 --> 00:02:58.327
"Roxy!" Mara said.

63
00:02:58.347 --> 00:02:59.968
"You missed it!"

64
00:03:01.708 --> 00:03:03.289
"Did you hear about King Trog?"

65
00:03:03.669 --> 00:03:04.370
Roxy asked.

66
00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:06.671
Everyone looked confused.

67
00:03:06.691 --> 00:03:10.934
"He's an ancient caveman king," Roxy said.

68
00:03:10.954 --> 00:03:14.237
"He woke up and tried to rule Metro City.

69
00:03:14.977 --> 00:03:16.398
Rocket Girl stopped him."

70
00:03:16.418 --> 00:03:19.380
"Awesome!" Terrell said.

71
00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:23.223
"I was talking about Jack," Mara said.

72
00:03:23.243 --> 00:03:27.465
"He balanced the pencil on his nose for ten seconds!"

73
00:03:28.446 --> 00:03:29.207
Jack grinned.

74
00:03:29.227 --> 00:03:30.788
"I did!"

75
00:03:31.873 --> 00:03:34.341
Roxy and Terrell looked at each other and smiled.
